Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Hook,,0,0,0,,HE WAS 15 YEARS OLD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing on The Tonight Show stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In front of millions of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Michael Jackson\Nwith the Jackson Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nineteen seventy-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch how he moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not a nervous kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a king being crowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He was fifteen years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And Michael Jackson was already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the greatest performer alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people are just born for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow for more moments like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:06.00,Outro,,0,0,0,,@mjforeverlove0
